{"seq":1,"slug":"translated-review-rank","title":"搬运评论排序与可信度加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-market-review-syndication/syndication-effect-trust/translated-review-rank","wordCount":2625,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"搬运评论排序与可信度加权\">搬运评论排序与可信度加权</h1><p>页面上的评论文本位置有限，只能展示前几条。这就有排序问题：本地评论与搬运评论混在一起时，谁排前面？直觉答案是「按时间」或「按有用票」，但这两个选择在搬运场景下都会出问题——按时间会让刚搬过来的旧评论全部顶到前面（搬运时间 ≠ 评论时间），按有用票会让本地评论碾压搬运评论（搬运评论在原站点积累的票数在目标市场不存在）。</p>\n<p>排序的目标不是给最好的评论最好的位置，而是<strong>让读者在最少阅读量下得到最准确的整体判断</strong>。这意味着排序要同时考虑内容的信息量、来源的可靠性、以及读者对来源的敏感度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>排序分数要能表达三件事：<strong>这条评论说了什么</strong>（内容质量与具体性）、<strong>这条评论从哪来</strong>（来源可靠性）、<strong>读者会怎么看待这个来源</strong>（来源接受度）。前两个可以用通用的排序特征处理，第三个是搬运场景特有的，也是决定搬运评论是否有价值的关键。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>正向信号</th>\n<th>负向信号</th>\n<th>搬运特有</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内容具体性</td>\n<td>含尺寸、时长、使用场景、对比</td>\n<td>纯情绪表达、无信息</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容信息密度</td>\n<td>说了具体失败模式</td>\n<td>泛泛而谈</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>来源可靠性</td>\n<td>原作者有历史评论记录</td>\n<td>新账号、单条评论</td>\n<td>是（跨站获取）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>来源接受度</td>\n<td>目标市场对该来源市场接受度高</td>\n<td>来源市场在目标市场口碑差</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间相关性</td>\n<td>与当前商品版本同期</td>\n<td>早于当前版本</td>\n<td>是（版本对应难）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行在搬运场景里格外麻烦：一条三年前在来源市场留下的评论，针对的可能是该商品的旧版本；搬运过来时商品可能已经改版。而搬运的<strong>展示时间</strong>是新的，很容易被误当成新评论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[商品评论池&lt;br/&gt;本地 + 搬运] --&gt; B[特征抽取]&#10;  B --&gt; C[内容特征&lt;br/&gt;具体性·信息密度·情感强度]&#10;  B --&gt; D[来源特征&lt;br/&gt;站点可靠性·原作者历史]&#10;  B --&gt; E[时间特征&lt;br/&gt;原始时间·商品版本对应]&#10;  C --&gt; F[排序分]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[多样性约束&lt;br/&gt;本地/搬运配额]&#10;  G --&gt; H[最终展示列表]&#10;  H --&gt; I[曝光与转化回流]&#10;  I --&gt; J[排序模型迭代]\">graph TD\n  A[商品评论池&lt;br/&gt;本地 + 搬运] --&gt; B[特征抽取]\n  B --&gt; C[内容特征&lt;br/&gt;具体性·信息密度·情感强度]\n  B --&gt; D[来源特征&lt;br/&gt;站点可靠性·原作者历史]\n  B --&gt; E[时间特征&lt;br/&gt;原始时间·商品版本对应]\n  C --&gt; F[排序分]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[多样性约束&lt;br/&gt;本地/搬运配额]\n  G --&gt; H[最终展示列表]\n  H --&gt; I[曝光与转化回流]\n  I --&gt; J[排序模型迭代]</pre><h3 id=\"归一化不是可选项\">归一化不是可选项</h3><p>搬运评论的有用票数、点赞数来自原站点，量纲与本地完全不同。直接把两个量级混在一起排序，等价于用两个市场的活跃度决定展示顺序。可行的做法是<strong>在各自站点内部做分位数归一化</strong>，把票数转换成该站点内的相对位置（百分位），再进入排序。这与上一章里评分基线校正的思路一致：跨市场比较前必须先消除量纲与基线差异。</p>\n<p>跨市场比较还有一个更容易被忽略的归一化对象：<strong>时间</strong>。搬运评论的原始发布时间与其对应商品版本的关系需要显式建模，因为不同市场的商品生命周期长度不同——同一件衣服在欧洲可能一年一版，在东南亚可能跟随季节每年两版。若直接比较原始时间，会把「来源市场版本迭代慢」误读为「这条评论更新」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排序分不能直接复用语料库的通用相关性分\">排序分不能直接复用语料库的通用相关性分</h3><p>检索系统的相关性打分是针对查询—文档匹配设计的，它的绝对数值依赖语料统计。以最常用的 BM25 为例，它的逆文档频率项是 <code>log(1 + (docCount - docFreq + 0.5) / (docFreq + 0.5))</code>，直接取决于该词在语料中出现的文档数；词频饱和由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（默认 1.2）控制，长度归一化由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（默认 0.75，取值 [0,1]）控制，且平均字段长度按 <code>sumTotalTermFreq / docCount</code> 计算（<a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/9_0_0/core/org/apache/lucene/search/similarities/BM25Similarity.html\">Lucene BM25Similarity</a>）。把一个文档从一个排序语境迁移到另一个语境时，它的分数会整体平移，因此分数只在同一语境内可比。搬运场景的对应做法是：先把候选评论按来源站点分组，在组内用相关性分排序，再把组内名次映射成统一的分位数后合并。这与上面票数归一化是同一条原则的第二个实例——<strong>跨语境合并前先归一到名次</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可信度加权的设计\">可信度加权的设计</h2><h3 id=\"权重应当作用于排序而非删除\">权重应当作用于排序而非删除</h3><p>一个常见的设计错误是把低可信度的搬运评论直接过滤掉。过滤会损失信息——一条来自可信度较低来源但描述了具体缺点的评论，对读者仍有价值。正确做法是让权重影响<strong>排序位置</strong>，而不是展示资格。只有当来源不满足合规或授权条件时才过滤，那是合规问题不是可信度问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"权重的三个来源\">权重的三个来源</h3><p>权重由三部分构成，分别对应三种不确定性。来源可靠性（该站点在历史上的评论真实性表现）、样本独立性（同来源的评论彼此相关，一条来源大量搬运评论应做折扣）、以及读者接受度（目标市场读者对该来源市场的信任程度，可从互动数据估计）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>site</mtext></msub></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = w_{\\text{rel}} \\cdot \\left(1 - \\alpha (1 - e^{-k/n_{\\text{site}}})\\right) \\cdot w_{\\text{accept}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.334em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">site</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>式中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>site</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{site}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">site</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该来源站点在该商品上的搬运评论条数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - e^{-k/n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的形式表达「来源越集中、折扣越强」。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{accept}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从目标市场的交互数据估计，初始值为 1，随着数据显示该来源评论的互动率低于本地评论而下降。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与聚合分的区别\">与聚合分的区别</h3><p>排序权重与上一章的聚合分权重是<strong>两套独立的权重</strong>，不应共用。聚合分要的是无偏的总体评分，排序要的是单条评论的展示价值；前者按来源做可信度折扣会让评分系统性偏移，后者不做折扣则会让某一来源垄断展示位。这个区分容易混淆，但它决定了两套参数应当分开调优、分开监控。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>权重作用对象</th>\n<th>错误的共用后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>聚合分（<a href=\"../review-aggregate-dedup/rating-aggregate-confidence\">见第一章</a>）</td>\n<td>无偏估计总体满意度</td>\n<td>每条评论对均值/计数贡献</td>\n<td>评分被来源折扣系统性拉低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序分（本篇）</td>\n<td>单条评论的展示价值</td>\n<td>该条评论的排序位置</td>\n<td>某一来源垄断或完全不可见</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多样性约束与配额\">多样性约束与配额</h2><h3 id=\"为什么要配额\">为什么要配额</h3><p>纯按分数排序会收敛到同质结果：同一来源、同一观点、同一表述风格的评论占据前排。读者看到的是重复信息，而真实分布里的少数意见被埋没。更严重的是，如果某个来源在分数上系统性占优（例如该来源用户更爱写长评），配额缺失会让页面看起来完全是外来评论，反而降低本地读者的认同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配额的设计\">配额的设计</h3><p>配额在两个维度上设：<strong>来源维度</strong>（本地与各搬运来源的展示位占比）和<strong>观点维度</strong>（正面与负面、以及各个方面的覆盖）。可用的实现是<strong>最大边际相关</strong>（MMR）式重排：在每次选择下一条时，同时考虑它的排序分与它与已选集合的差异度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按来源配额重排：每来源最多 40% 展示位，本地至少 30%&#10;WITH ranked AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    review_id, origin_site, sort_score,&#10;    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY origin_site ORDER BY sort_score DESC) AS rn_site,&#10;    COUNT(*) OVER () AS pool_size&#10;  FROM review_candidate&#10;  WHERE review_id IN (SELECT review_id FROM display_eligible)&#10;)&#10;SELECT review_id, origin_site, sort_score&#10;FROM ranked&#10;WHERE rn_site &lt;= GREATEST(1, CEIL(pool_size * 0.4))&#10;ORDER BY sort_score DESC&#10;LIMIT 8\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按来源配额重排：每来源最多 40% 展示位，本地至少 30%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    review_id, origin_site, sort_score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origin_site </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sort_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rn_site,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> review_candidate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> review_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> review_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> display_eligible)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> review_id, origin_site, sort_score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rn_site </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, CEIL(pool_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sort_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询是配额的骨架而非完整实现：真实系统还要在配额之上做观点覆盖约束，并且配额参数应当按商品可用的评论构成自适应——一个只有 3 条本地评论的商品强行保留 30% 本地位，会把展示位浪费掉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"版本对应与时间衰减\">版本对应与时间衰减</h3><p>搬运评论的原始发布时间与其对应的商品版本必须一起展示或一起参与排序。做法是在商品实体上维护版本时间轴（见 <a href=\"../review-aggregate-dedup/cross-site-product-match\">跨站点商品身份匹配</a> 里关于实体记录的设计），并把评论的原始时间映射到版本区间上。早于当前版本多个版本的评论应做时间衰减，衰减强度按品类调整——服装类改版影响大，家居类影响小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排序效果的回流\">排序效果的回流</h2><h3 id=\"需要观测什么\">需要观测什么</h3><p>排序的效果不能只看点击率，因为点击率高可能只是标题党。更有价值的观测是<strong>阅读深度</strong>（展开了长评的比例）、<strong>后续行为</strong>（看完评论后的加购与下单）、以及<strong>退货率</strong>（看评论后购买的商品退货率是否更低，这是评论信息是否有用的强信号）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"冷启动与探索\">冷启动与探索</h3><p>新来源的评论初始权重低会导致永远得不到曝光，从而永远无法积累效果数据——这是典型的冷启动陷阱。解法是在展示位里保留固定的探索配额，给新来源少量曝光，并用其互动数据更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{accept}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。探索配额必须记录在展示日志里，否则效果度量会把探索流量误当成常规流量，稀释真实效应。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;display_id&quot;: &quot;dp_31a0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;peid&quot;: &quot;pe_4410&quot;,&#10;  &quot;target_market&quot;: &quot;de&quot;,&#10;  &quot;slots&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;pos&quot;: 1, &quot;review_id&quot;: &quot;rv_9031&quot;, &quot;origin_site&quot;: &quot;local&quot;, &quot;bucket&quot;: &quot;exploit&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;pos&quot;: 2, &quot;review_id&quot;: &quot;rv_2210&quot;, &quot;origin_site&quot;: &quot;site_b&quot;, &quot;bucket&quot;: &quot;exploit&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;pos&quot;: 3, &quot;review_id&quot;: &quot;rv_7781&quot;, &quot;origin_site&quot;: &quot;site_c&quot;, &quot;bucket&quot;: &quot;explore&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;rank_model_version&quot;: &quot;rk_2026_09_20&quot;,&#10;  &quot;quota_config&quot;: { &quot;local_min&quot;: 0.3, &quot;site_max&quot;: 0.4 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"display_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dp_31a0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"peid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pe_4410\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"target_market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E