ark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"site_b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"exploit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"pos\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"review_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rv_7781\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"origin_site\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"site_c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"explore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rank_model_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rk_2026_09_20\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quota_config\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"local_min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"site_max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>bucket</code> 字段把探索与常规流量分开标记，是后续归因分析的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>搬运评论排序要同时表达内容质量、来源可靠性与读者对来源的接受度，第三项是搬运场景特有且决定其价值。</li>\n<li>跨市场票数与互动量必须先在各自站点内做分位数归一化再比较，否则展示顺序由市场活跃度决定。</li>\n<li>可信度权重应作用于排序位置而非展示资格；只有合规与授权不满足时才过滤。</li>\n<li>权重公式综合来源可靠性、来源集中度折扣与读者接受度；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{accept}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从目标市场交互数据估计。</li>\n<li>聚合分权重与排序权重是两套独立参数，共用会让评分系统性偏移或让某来源垄断展示位。</li>\n<li>多样性配额要在来源与观点两个维度上设，并随商品可用评论构成自适应；用 MMR 式重排在分数与差异度间平衡。</li>\n<li>评论原始时间必须映射到商品版本区间并做时间衰减，衰减强度按品类调整。</li>\n<li>效果观测除点击率外要看阅读深度、后续行为与退货率；必须保留探索配额并标记 <code>bucket</code> 以区分探索流量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"搬运评论排序与可信度加权","id":"搬运评论排序与可信度加权"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"归一化不是可选项","id":"归一化不是可选项"},{"level":3,"text":"排序分不能直接复用语料库的通用相关性分","id":"排序分不能直接复用语料库的通用相关性分"},{"level":2,"text":"可信度加权的设计","id":"可信度加权的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"权重应当作用于排序而非删除","id":"权重应当作用于排序而非删除"},{"level":3,"text":"权重的三个来源","id":"权重的三个来源"},{"level":3,"text":"与聚合分的区别","id":"与聚合分的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"多样性约束与配额","id":"多样性约束与配额"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么要配额","id":"为什么要配额"},{"level":3,"text":"配额的设计","id":"配额的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"版本对应与时间衰减","id":"版本对应与时间衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"排序效果的回流","id":"排序效果的回流"},{"level":3,"text":"需要观测什么","id":"需要观测什么"},{"level":3,"text":"冷启动与探索","id":"冷启动与探索"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"搬运策略规则与可搬矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-market-review-syndication/syndication-compliance/syndication-policy-rule"},"next":{"title":"来源市场信任信号展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-market-review-syndication/syndication-effect-trust/syndication-trust-signal"}}